WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.067
Book a visit, a phone call or a task.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:13.233
New appointment. Opens the booking form. Visits, phone calls and tasks all start here (or from a customer, with their details filled in).

00:00:13.733 --> 00:00:20.400
What is it?. Start with what it is: a Visit, a Phone call or a Task. The form changes to fit.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:27.167
Visit. A visit has a place and a time: estimate visits, site visits and service calls.

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:34.967
The customer. Type a name, phone or street and pick them. Leave it empty for an internal task or meeting.

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:42.233
What for. A short line everyone understands, like "Estimate visit · back patio". It's required.

00:00:42.733 --> 00:00:50.800
Type. Estimate visit, Site visit or Service. After an estimate visit it can be marked Visit done · estimate pending.

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:57.867
Priority. Low, Normal, High or Urgent. High and Urgent show a red tag on the lists.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:04.200
Date. The day it happens. It's also the due date, so it's on that person's day straight away.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:10.467
From and To. Pick a start and the end follows an hour later, or leave it at Any time.

00:01:10.967 --> 00:01:17.067
With. Who goes. Only people who take appointments are listed (set on Team & crews).

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:23.033
Notes. Anything the person should know: a gate code, what the customer asked for.

00:01:23.533 --> 00:01:26.600
Phone call. Now let's make it a phone call.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:38.067
Call at and who calls. A call has one time (15 minutes) and Who calls. Its type is Call back or Collection, and the call's subject goes in What the call is about.

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:43.600
Task. And a task: any to-do, an internal meeting, an order to place.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:52.967
Anyone, crews included. A task can go to anyone in the company. It shows on their My day and their phone until they mark it done.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:02:00.433
Book it. Book it saves it onto that person's day; Cancel throws it away. The tour doesn't save anything.

00:02:00.933 --> 00:02:04.467
Close it. The X closes the form without booking.

00:02:04.967 --> 00:02:10.567
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
